
  [1mMy testing plan:[0m [38;5;153mnode:test[39m + [38;5;153mnode:assert[39m, both built into Node, so the repo stays zero-dependency. [38;5;153mpackage.json[39m gets
  [38;5;153m"scripts": { "test": "node --test" }[39m alongside the [38;5;153m"type": "module"[39m change from Section 1.

